    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxing turn based puzzle adventure game. You have been taken to a mysterious enclosed island. Your body seems to have undergone changes, and the creature in front of you feels delicious, hungry, crispy, delicious, and then feels full of strength.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based puzzle game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time is a different experience, the monster's position is random, and the road is random.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eating delicious food increases your stats.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting items can also make you stronger.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical\u00a0damage and multiple damage, making it easy for players.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxing turn based puzzle adventure game. You have been taken to a mysterious enclosed island. Your body seems to have undergone changes, and the creature in front of you feels delicious, hungry, crispy, delicious, and then feels full of strength.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based puzzle game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time is a different experience, the monster's position is random, and the road is random.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eating delicious food increases your stats.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting items can also make you stronger.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical\u00a0damage and multiple damage, making it easy for players.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This is a relaxing turn based puzzle adventure game. This is a closed island, so hungry. Anyway, first defeat the creatures on the island to fill your stomach, and then walk all the way to the other end of the island.",
